# Test: O2 (triplet) PUMP2 geometry optimization / cc-pVDZ
# Open-shell triplet, starting from a stretched geometry.
#
# Optimizer: Cartesian BFGS (diatomic).
# Gradient:  numerical PUMP2 (central FD, h=1e-3 Bohr).
#
%method  MP2
%basis   cc-pVDZ
%spherical
%job     optimize
%charge  0
%mult    3
%spin    unrestricted
%pump2   yes
%frozen_core 2
%geom_maxiter 30

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
O   0.000000   0.000000   1.230000
*end
